      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005010060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あら、誰もいないんですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600501/2016005010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ。蒸し暑いな……\r\n早くエアコンを入れて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n……あれ、全然動かない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005010070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "リモコンの電池が切れてるとか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600501/2016005010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、この前新しいのを入れたばっかりだし\r\nそんなはずはないんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005010080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それじゃあ、故障でしょうか……\r\n業者さんに連絡してみるしかないですかね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600501/2016005010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。修理されるまでは扇風機でどうにかするか\r\nえっと、確か棚の奥にあったはず──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
