  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "業者の人、忙しいみたいですぐには来られないそうだ\r\nうーん、ついてないなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005010090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうですかぁ……\r\n……困りましたね……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600501/2016005010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あれ、そういえば\r\nさっきの扇風機はどうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005010100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そ、それがですね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600501/2016005010100"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
