  {
    "id": 2016005010220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……それにしても\r\n今日のスイカは、一層美味しく感じます……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600501/2016005010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005010230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "暑さと、スイカの大きさと……それに\r\nプロデューサーさんと一緒に食べてるからでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600501/2016005010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、今日はついてないと思ったけど……\r\nこんなに美味しいスイカが食べられるなら、感謝だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005010240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、そうですね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
